---
import ProsePage from '../../components/ProsePage.astro';
---

<ProsePage page="privacy">
  <section>
    <h2>Controller</h2>
    <p>
      For any question about your personal data, contact us at
      <a href="mailto:contact@yardage.io">contact@yardage.io</a>.
      Billing for Yardage orders is handled by PLATEFORME IO.
    </p>

    <h2>Data collected</h2>
    <p>
      The contact form collects the information you provide (name, email, club, volume, message) in
      order to respond to your quote request or digital sample request.
    </p>

    <h2>Purpose</h2>
    <p>
      This data is used only for commercial follow-up and relationships with golf clubs and
      professionals interested in Yardage. It is not sold to third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Processors</h2>
    <p>
      The contact form is sent through Formspree. The site is hosted by GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc.).
      Fonts are installed on the site: no third-party service is called to display them. Please consult those providers’ privacy policies for more information.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data by writing to
      <a href="mailto:contact@yardage.io">contact@yardage.io</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</ProsePage>
